WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.219
Open the app in your browser. The sign-in page appears.

2
00:00:03.219 --> 00:00:05.406
Choose «Student».

3
00:00:05.406 --> 00:00:07.547
Pick your language: Azərbaycanca, English or Русский.

4
00:00:09.094 --> 00:00:12.016
Type the sign-in code your teacher gave you (e.g. XE-001).

5
00:00:12.016 --> 00:00:14.656
Type your 4-digit PIN. Never share it.

6
00:00:14.656 --> 00:00:16.172
Press «Sign in» – you are in!
